Subject: [PATCH 235/260] [ae-patch] Keep distinct approval answers distinct
 when their labels shorten

Review findings on the short labels: two answers sharing a first clause kept the full labels instead of reading alike; the cut counts code points so an emoji is never split; and a cut that lands on a space keeps its last whole word.
